OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing void' found under sea    
OL,4,Apool wall                              
OL,6,FEngineers have found a growing hole    
OL,7,Funder the wall of a sea pool, despite  
OL,8,Fprevious attempts to repair the        
OL,9,Fstructure.                             
OL,11,FJersey's Victoria Marine Lake has been 
OL,12,Fclosed since July, following safety    
OL,13,Fconcerns.                              
OL,15,FThe Infrastructure minister said       
OL,16,Fassessments had been carried out to    
OL,17,F"highlight the risks of swimming near  
OL,18,Fthe dangerous structure".              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
