OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing void' found under sea    
OL,4,Apool wall                              
OL,6,FA petition calling on ministers to     
OL,7,F"find the funds to repair and maintain"
OL,8,Fthe pool has crossed 1,000 signatures. 
OL,9,FIt means the government must respond.  
